#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:424
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt1Intro"
msgid ""
"No! Those TEAM MAGMA goons got\n"
"here ahead of us!\p"
"We can't fall behind!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:429
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid ""
"I thought you were one of the MAGMAS\n"
"who happened to come back…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Yeah, so you are strong…\n"
"But there're a lot of us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:437
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"Hah!\n"
"Too bad for you!\p"
"If you came earlier, you only would've\n"
"had to battle the wimpy TEAM MAGMA.\p"
"But since you arrived now, you have\n"
"to take on us toughies!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:445
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid ""
"Urgh… I should've let you take on\n"
"TEAM MAGMA first…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:449
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"You don't know anything!\n"
"So why are you messing with us?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:453
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt3Intro"
msgid ""
"You…\n"
"We saw you at MT. CHIMNEY.\p"
"You don't belong to either TEAM,\n"
"so why would you be here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:459
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt3Defeat"
msgid ""
"If you're going to mess with anyone,\n"
"let it be TEAM MAGMA…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:463
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt3PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Heh, it doesn't matter!\n"
"We bought ourselves some time!\p"
"The BOSS should have snatched what\n"
"he was after!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:469
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt4Intro"
msgid ""
"Oh, I know!\n"
"You tried to join TEAM MAGMA,\l"
"but they wouldn't have you!\p"
"Well, don't think that we'll let you\n"
"join our TEAM AQUA!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:476
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt4Defeat"
msgid ""
"If you want to join TEAM AQUA that\n"
"badly, we can consider it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:480
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_Grunt4PostBattle"
msgid ""
"We have a great combination going\n"
"with us members and our leader.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:484
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_ArchieWeGotTheOrbLetsGo"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: TEAM MAGMA's MAXIE got ahead\n"
"of us, but we also got what we wanted.\p"
"The RED ORB preserved at MT. PYRE…\n"
"I, ARCHIE, now have it in my possession!\p"
"Fufufu… Now we can bring our ultimate\n"
"objective to fruition!\p"
"Okay, TEAM!\n"
"We're pulling out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:494
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_BothOrbsTakenMagmaLeftThis"
msgid ""
"Oh, no…\n"
"This cannot happen…\p"
"Not only the BLUE ORB, but even\n"
"the RED ORB has been taken…\p"
"The BLUE ORB and RED ORB must never\n"
"be separated. They belong together.\p"
"What are those men trying to do with\n"
"the two ORBS?\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Oh, yes. Was it TEAM MAGMA who came\n"
"and took the BLUE ORB first?\p"
"Well, in their haste, they left this\n"
"behind.\p"
"I couldn't imagine what exactly it\n"
"could be.\p"
"I would like you to have it.\n"
"Perhaps it will be useful in some way.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:514
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_OrbsHaveBeenTaken"
msgid ""
"The BLUE ORB and RED ORB taken by\n"
"those sinister men…\p"
"They must never be apart…\n"
"I fear something terrible will happen…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:520
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_GroudonKyogreAwakened"
msgid ""
"Oh, my goodness…\p"
"You say that both GROUDON and KYOGRE\n"
"have been awakened?\p"
"It is said that the BLUE ORB and\n"
"the RED ORB quelled the rage of\l"
"the two POKéMON…\p"
"It is also said that the true owner\n"
"of the ORBS still exists.\p"
"However, no one knows who, or what\n"
"exactly, the ORBS belong to.\p"
"It could be a human, or perhaps\n"
"a POKéMON, but no one knows.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:534
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_ThoseTwoMenReturnedOrbs"
msgid ""
"The two men who took the ORBS came\n"
"back to return them on their own.\p"
"Those men…\n"
"Perhaps they are not so evil after all…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:540
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_SuperAncientPokemonTaughtUs"
msgid ""
"The embodiments of the land, sea,\n"
"and the sky…\p"
"That is said to be the identities of\n"
"the super-ancient POKéMON…\p"
"In the same way that we humans and\n"
"POKéMON have life, our world, too,\l"
"is alive…\p"
"The super-ancient POKéMON have\n"
"taught us that…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:551
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_WillYouHearOutMyTale"
msgid ""
"MT. PYRE is where we calm the spirits\n"
"of POKéMON that have passed on…\p"
"This is a high place where one can\n"
"see all of HOENN…\p"
"The disembodied spirits of POKéMON\n"
"must find solace here…\p"
"Is it coincidence that you are here…\p"
"Will you hear out my tale? A tale long\n"
"told in the HOENN region?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:562
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_GroudonKyogreTale"
msgid ""
"It happened long, long ago…\p"
"The world was wracked by a ferocious\n"
"clash between the POKéMON of the land\l"
"and the POKéMON of the sea…\p"
"The POKéMON of the land raised\n"
"mountains and created continents…\p"
"The POKéMON of the sea raised huge\n"
"waves and carved out oceans…\p"
"Their fierce duel raged without end.\p"
"The world was engulfed in massive\n"
"infernos and vicious storms.\p"
"The BLUE ORB and the RED ORB brought\n"
"an end to the calamity.\p"
"Light poured from the two ORBS and\n"
"becalmed the enraged adversaries.\p"
"The pair, made docile, dove deep into\n"
"the sea where eventually they\l"
"disappeared…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:582
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_WellThatTooIsFine"
msgid ""
"I see…\n"
"Well, that, too, is fine…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:586
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_MaxieSilence"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: {PLAYER}…\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:591
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_HearTheNewLegendOfHoenn"
msgid ""
"It is my role to pass on the legends\n"
"of HOENN to future generations.\p"
"And the crisis that just ended in\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS rewrote a legend…\p"
"Have you the time to hear the new\n"
"legend of HOENN?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc:599
msgctxt "MtPyre_Summit_Text_HoennTrioTale"
msgid ""
"It happened long, long ago…\p"
"The world was wracked by a ferocious\n"
"clash between the POKéMON of the land\l"
"and the POKéMON of the sea…\p"
"The POKéMON of the land raised\n"
"mountains and created continents…\p"
"The POKéMON of the sea raised huge\n"
"waves and carved out oceans…\p"
"Their fierce duel raged without end.\p"
"The world was engulfed in massive\n"
"fires and vicious storms.\p"
"It was then that the POKéMON of\n"
"the sky descended from a storm.\p"
"The POKéMON, shining a vivid green,\n"
"becalmed the two enraged POKéMON.\p"
"Then, its duty done, the green POKéMON\n"
"flew off into the wild blue yonder…$"
msgstr ""
